+### Updating Instances (Maintenance)
+
+**NGINX Cluster:**
+
+Config changes to our NGINX instances are maintained on GitHub, these should be
+deployed on each instance like so:
+
+1. SSH into the instance and enter sudo
+
+   ```bash
